    "body": "Thank you for this report and for the exact reproduction.\n\nTriage: `P1`, `effort:high`. A second setup that runs on the part of the first setup can cause a collision, so this is unsafe output. A `P1` is worked before all other work. An agent starts on it now.\n\nIf you have a program file from your own machine that shows how the control expects a setup change (a stop, a home move, or a new program), please add it here. Please do not attach output from Fusion 360 or HSMWorks: this project is clean-room.\n",
